Subject : Force Majeure
To : SINWSG/JOE

Due to on going issue at the terminals of NHAVA SHEVA, MUMBAI we have decided to apply usd 75 per teu for all Inbound cargo .

Vessels are bypassing or only performing 50% of their moves. Which in turn has financial impact to the carriers bottom line.

The key points are as follows.


  *   Applicable for local Nhava Sheva discharge and cargo for ICD via gateway Nhava Sheva.
  *   The same is not applicable for cargo inbounds from US and Canada
  *   Effective date immediate
  *   Services FIX/ICS/IMU/ITS/TIX
  *   The same will be termed as " Force Majeure surcharge"
  *   Under charge code "DPS"



Pls forward this announcement to all origin offices as info.



rgds,



benhur leon

